00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.270
as an ongoing practice,

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:09.700
I wish it was more accessible,
Better Help is making it so.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:12.530
So go to BetterHelp.com/JohnnyHarris,

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:16.620
that's BetterHELP.com/JohnnyHarris

